;bhgeRFCFailureMailTemplate;Velocity template for BHGE RFC Failure ;bhgeRFCFailureMailTemplate_media;com.bhge.core.mailmessages.context.BHGERFCFailureMailContext;text/html;velocity
;BHGEInvalidDataReportMailTemplate;Velocity template for BHGE Invalid Data Reportemail;bhgeInvalidDataReportMailTemplate_media;com.bhge.core.mailmessages.context.BHGEInvalidDataReportMailContext;text/html;velocity
;BHGEWeeklyOrderReportMailTemplate;Velocity template for BHGE Weekly Order Report Email;bhgeWeeklyOrderReportMailTemplate_media;com.bhge.core.mailmessages.context.BHGEWeeklyOrdersReportMailContext;text/html;velocity
;bhgeMaterialPushEmailTemplate;Velocity template for material push email;bhgeMaterialPushMailTemplate_media;com.bhge.core.mailmessages.context.BHGEMaterialPushEmailContext;text/html;velocity
;NoNCriticalErrorMailTemplate;Velocity template for Non CriticalErrorMail;bhgeNonCriticalErrorMailTemplate_media;com.bhge.core.mailmessages.context.BHGENonCriticalErrorEmailContext;text/html;velocity
;BHGEOrderConfEmailFaliureTemplate;Velocity template for BHGE Order Confirmation Email Failure ;bhgeOrderConfEmailFailureTemplate_media;com.bhge.core.mailmessages.context.BHGEOrderConfirmationEmailFailureContext;text/html;velocity
;bhgeActiveUsersEmailTemplate;Velocity template for BHGE Active Users Report;bhgeActiveUsersEmailTemplate_media;com.bhge.core.mailmessages.context.BHGEActiveUsersEmailContext;text/html;velocity
;BHGEPendingActivationUsersMailTemplate;Velocity template for BHGE Pending Actication Users Report Email;bhgePendingActivationUsersReportMailTemplate_media;com.bhge.core.mailmessages.context.BHGEPendingActivationUsersMailContext;text/html;velocity
;BHGEInactiveUserListMailTemplate;Velocity template for BHGE Inactive Users Report Email;bhgeInactiveUsersReportMailTemplate_media;com.bhge.core.mailmessages.context.BHGEInactiveUsersMailContext;text/html;velocity

 
 
